notes = section('sources', '<div class="comparison-reading comparison-disclosure"><h2>Sources and comparison approach.</h2><p>Official pages checked ' + CHECKED + '. Descriptions reflect the public information available on that date, not a hands-on test of another agency. Our fit recommendations are editorial judgments. Providers can change pricing, scope and terms.</p><ul>' + source_list + '<li><a href="/pricing">The Revenue Inbox — current plans and pricing</a></li></ul><p>For any quote, ask about minimum term, cancellation, infrastructure ownership and meeting acceptance. A detail missing from a public page does not establish that the provider lacks it. We have not assigned a price, contract term or guarantee policy to Belkins that we could not verify.</p></div>')
